abstract: >-
  Public research infrastructure for a structured documentary content analysis
  of school-security and emergency-preparedness frameworks. Supports L0
  framework / L1 document / L2 prescriptive-element coding with separate
  protective-action executability and threat-detectability branches.
  This repository is not an effectiveness study and does not redistribute
  copyrighted framework PDFs by default.
